# Original fictional watershed-monitoring corpus for operational trials.
requirement OPS-RESILIENT-001
title: Continue during infrastructure outages
statement:
  The monitoring service shall preserve essential monitoring and alerting capability during bounded power and communication outages.
rationale:
  Severe weather can disrupt the infrastructure needed to observe the same event.
end requirement

requirement SYS-RESILIENT-POWER-001
title: Operate on reserve power
statement:
  Each station shall continue sampling and local hazard detection for at least 24 hours after loss of external power.
decomposes: OPS-RESILIENT-001
end requirement

requirement POWER-RESERVE-001
title: Supply reserve energy
statement:
  The station power unit shall provide energy for 24 hours of essential station operation without external input.
decomposes: SYS-RESILIENT-POWER-001
end requirement

requirement EDGE-LOWPOWER-001
title: Enter essential mode
statement:
  The station processor shall disable nonessential functions within one minute after detecting loss of external power.
decomposes: SYS-RESILIENT-POWER-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-RESILIENT-STORE-001
title: Store data during communication loss
statement:
  Each station shall retain at least 72 hours of samples and detected hazards while communication is unavailable.
decomposes: OPS-RESILIENT-001
end requirement

requirement EDGE-STORE-001
title: Buffer samples locally
statement:
  The station processor shall store qualified samples in nonvolatile local storage when delivery is unavailable.
decomposes: SYS-RESILIENT-STORE-001
end requirement

requirement EDGE-PRIORITY-001
title: Preserve hazard records
statement:
  The station processor shall retain detected hazard records in preference to ordinary samples when local storage is exhausted.
decomposes: SYS-RESILIENT-STORE-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-RESILIENT-RECOVER-001
title: Recover after communication restoration
statement:
  Each station shall resume current-data delivery and transfer retained records after communication is restored.
decomposes: OPS-RESILIENT-001
end requirement

requirement LINK-RECONNECT-001
title: Reestablish station link
statement:
  The communication unit shall retry connection using bounded backoff until the gateway acknowledges the station.
decomposes: SYS-RESILIENT-RECOVER-001
end requirement

requirement EDGE-BACKLOG-001
title: Transfer retained records
statement:
  The station processor shall transfer retained hazard records before retained ordinary samples.
decomposes: SYS-RESILIENT-RECOVER-001
end requirement
